### Add meta option to post 9 (John Doe - test post)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/v1/posts/9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "metaOption": {
    "metaValue": "{\"seo\":{\"index\":true,\"priority\":0.5},\"keywords\":[\"testing\",\"nestjs\"]}"
  }
}

### Full patch example (update title, status, tags)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/v1/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Getting started with NestJS - Updated",
  "postType": "post",
  "slug": "getting-started-with-nestjs-updated",
  "status": "published",
  "content": "This is the updated full content of the post.",
  "schema": "article",
  "featuredImageUrl": "https://example.com/images/post-cover-updated.png",
  "publishOn": "2026-06-15T10:00:00.000Z",
  "tags": [
    "https://example.com/tags/nestjs",
    "https://example.com/tags/typescript"
  ],
  "metaOption": {
    "metaValue": "{\"seo\":{\"index\":true,\"priority\":0.8},\"keywords\":[\"nestjs\",\"backend\"]}"
  }
}